      "id": "b9617e3f-0c66-45cf-a34e-ef76a2e5f455",
      "name": "Workflow Due Date Rules",
      "description": {
        "content": "A workflow due date rule defines how the checklist-level due date is calculated\nfor workflow runs — either relative to the run's start date or derived from a\nDate form field value. Use these endpoints to set or clear the checklist due\ndate rule on a draft workflow revision.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
